{"version":1,"content":"<p>全球雲服務與網絡安全公司Cloudflare於2026年10月21日宣佈，已針對PHP編程語言中被稱為「php2shell」的兩項嚴重安全漏洞部署Web應用防火牆（WAF）防護規則。這兩項漏洞的編號分別為CVE-2026-109618和CVE-2026-109619，可能導致拒絕服務、遠程代碼執行及敏感數據泄露。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583244.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T15:41:45.225419+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":162,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T14:38:41+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.633892+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.633892+00:00","content_hash":"240288fe45858571626fd8473964547398bfad5f79658879d1cddffcc741fdd2","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}